    <briefdescription>
<para>Checking whether two cases of <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_s_i" kindref="compound">SI</ref> are equal depends on the contents of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_block" kindref="compound">BasicBlock</ref> and the incoming values of their successor PHINodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_p_h_i_node_1ab2db7609ec72b1af2f91d47e40dc3722" kindref="member">PHINode::getIncomingValueForBlock</ref> is O(|Preds|), so we&apos;d like to avoid calling this function on each <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_block" kindref="compound">BasicBlock</ref> every time isEqual is called, especially since the same <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_block" kindref="compound">BasicBlock</ref> may be passed as an argument multiple times. To do this, we can precompute a map of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_p_h_i_node" kindref="compound">PHINode</ref> -&gt; Pred <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_basic_block" kindref="compound">BasicBlock</ref> -&gt; IncomingValue and add it in the Wrapper so isEqual can do O(1) checking of the incoming values. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
